{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208290","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320829001:1":{"text":"若いの！その手に持ってる彫刻刀は、酒場で拾ったのか？","source_cn":"喂！小伙子！你手里的雕刻刀，是在酒馆捡到的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF777FD199B2793C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::0":{"text":"彫刻刀","source_cn":"刻刀","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF463B239694679B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320829002:0":{"text":"彫刻刀？皮剥ぎナイフじゃないのか？少し変な見た目してるけど……","source_cn":"雕刻刀？这不是剥皮刀吗？虽然造型奇怪了点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x201A305B1621DEBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320829003:1":{"text":"刃先をよく見ろ。出っ張りの形が違うだろ？","source_cn":"你仔细看那把刀的刀头，凸起的刀刃形状各个不一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEFC4363D209A35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320829004:1":{"text":"それは異なる角度に合わせて、細かく彫るために設計されてるんだ。それで皮を剥いだら、刃も損傷するし、皮も傷付くぞ！","source_cn":"是为了在不同角度进行精细的雕琢，如果你拿去剥皮，刀刃会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5594D496C7B6945B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320829005:1":{"text":"だ、だとしても、これは俺が拾ったんだから、どう使うかは俺の勝手だろ！ウサギの皮剥ぎぐらいならいけるさ。","source_cn":"但这是我捡到的……！要怎么用是我的事！我看它好得很，剥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D4A230F37B1A230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320829006:1":{"text":"まったく、なんでどいつもこいつもルールを守らないんだ。彫刻刀で皮を剥げるわけないだろ！","source_cn":"啧，你们总是在这种事上打破规矩，刻刀怎么能用来剥皮呢……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x720F54CF96E909AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320829007:1":{"text":"分かったぞ、獲物を仕留めたのはお前さんじゃないな？","source_cn":"我知道了，狩猎的一定不是你吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3C9DB6BB4DA3C00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320829008:1":{"text":"狩ったのはオヤジだけど。","source_cn":"是俺爹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DB63FD51F2031BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320829009:1":{"text":"やっぱりな。だからお前さんは、苦労して手にした成果を、他人に台無しにされる者の気持ちが分からないんだ。","source_cn":"这就对了，你不是亲自狩猎的人，所以不知道付出辛劳后的收...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D32749B400A16A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320829010:1":{"text":"確かにお前さんがその彫刻刀を